@Community_member_A — tap "Just sync activity" (or "Merge" if shown) to keep your existing history; "Take over this device" typically replaces the local account and can overwrite history, so only use that after you back up the original device.  
@Community_member_B — try Settings > Sync/Refresh (or force‑quit and reopen the app), ensure the device has internet and background/data permissions, and confirm you’re on the latest app version; if it still shows yesterday’s data, sign out/in to force a full resync.  
@Community_member_C — totally fine to join late; a daily check‑in is completing/logging a qualifying session in the app (posting photos here is optional and encouraged but not required).  
If anyone wants, drop a screenshot of the pairing prompt or the Today/Daily Summary card here (or DM me) and I’ll walk you through the exact taps.
